<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka's Jan-Feb '97 coconut down 4.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka's Jan-Feb '97 coconut down 4.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's coconut production in the first two months of this year dropped by 4.3 percent to 403 million nuts against the same period last year, the Central Bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>It said in its latest economic report that coconut output in January-February 1996 was 421 million nuts.</p>
</text>
